      288  Freedom of religion
      289  [ edit ]
      290  Main article: Freedom of religion in Taiwan
      291  Freedom of religion is enshrined in the constitution of the Republic of China (Taiwan) , and ranked high at 9.2 on the Freedom Scale in 2018 according to the World Bank . [ 58 ] In 2023, Taiwan scored 4 out of 4 under Freedom House 's metric, "Are individuals free to practice and express their religious faith or nonbelief in public and private?". [ 59 ]
